@base = http://localhost:8080

### Регистрация
POST {{base}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "anna@example.com", "password": "secret123"}

### Вход
# @name login
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "anna@example.com", "password": "secret123"}

### Создать задачу
POST {{base}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Задача Анны"}

### Список задач
GET {{base}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Кто я
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}